{
  "system_name": "AWS ECS Fullstack App (Terraform Demo)",
  "description": "MIT-0 AWS sample: a Vue.js SPA (client) and a Node.js/Express API (server) run as separate ECS Fargate services behind two internet-facing Application Load Balancers in a single VPC, provisioned entirely by Terraform. A GitHub-triggered CodePipeline (CodeBuild + CodeDeploy blue/green) builds Docker images to ECR and deploys to ECS. The API returns a product catalog from a DynamoDB table; images are served from an S3 bucket. Both ALBs (including the backend/API ALB) are public and HTTP-only; the app has no authentication or authorization.",
